+#### Step 4 — The recursion breaker silences every `reflect` command (O8) `[FREE]`
+
+**Do:**
+
+```bash
+cd /tmp
+SUPERCLAUDE_REFLECT_WRAPPER_ACTIVE=1 superclaude reflect contract-status; echo "exit=$?"
+SUPERCLAUDE_REFLECT_WRAPPER_ACTIVE=1 superclaude reflect run /tmp/no-such-task.md; echo "exit=$?"
